Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2-NVFP4-MLP-Infernix (the drafter folder of wallawalla47/Inkling-2-Mini-Infernix)
A conversion of incoai/Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2 for Infernix, by Wallawalla47.

The model is Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2 (https://huggingface.co/incoai/Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2,
revision 4f9088ea66c21f2b99ed657d1941c306b03e84d2), a DFlash 2 draft model by incoai for
thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes made in this conversion (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b)):

  - The checkpoint was converted into the Infernix v3 companion artifact
    Inkling-2-Mini-DFlash2-NVFP4-MLP-Infernix.infernix (one file) with the inkling2_mini_dflash2_nvfp4_mlp
    recipe of Infernix's tools.convert, its target configuration checked against thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini's.
  - Each layer's MLP gate/up and down projections are re-quantized to NVIDIA's NVFP4 format (FP8 scales per
    16 weights); the attention query/key/value, attention output and target-feature projections to
    q8_g32_fp16 (8-bit integer codes with an FP16 absmax scale per group of 32), the query/key/value fused
    into one matrix per layer.
  - The candidate selector, the dynamic convolutions and every norm keep their BF16 values; the selector's
    codebooks keep the rows of the 200,058 assigned tokens, leaving out the checkpoint's padding rows, which no
    token id can reach.
  - The artifact holds no tokenizer, embedding or output head of its own: it reads the main artifact's.
  - README.md and the conversion report added.
